A booking has been cancelled

A customer has cancelled their booking with <%= @business.business_name %>.

CUSTOMER DETAILS

Name: <%= [@user.first_name, @user.last_name].compact.join(" ") %>
Email: <%= @user.email %>
<% if @user.phone_number.present? %>
  Phone: <%= @user.phone_number %>
<% end %>

CANCELLED BOOKING DETAILS

Service: <%= @service.name %>
Date: <%= @booking.date.strftime("%A, %d %B %Y") %>
Time: <%= @booking.time.strftime("%H:%M") %>
Service price: £<%= number_with_precision(@service.price || 0, precision: 2) %>
<% if (@booking.amount_paid || 0) > 0 %>
  Amount paid: £<%= number_with_precision(@booking.amount_paid, precision: 2) %>
<% end %>
<% if @remaining_balance > 0 %>
  Remaining balance: £<%= number_with_precision(@remaining_balance, precision: 2) %>
<% end %>

The booking has been marked as cancelled and the appointment slot can now become available for another customer.